367
00:25:48,855 --> 00:25:52,771
So it's not simply
that she has a high sex drive.

368
00:25:52,855 --> 00:25:54,063
Right.

369
00:25:54,146 --> 00:25:57,605
It's addictive behavior that won't stop
until the urge is acted on.

370
00:25:57,688 --> 00:26:03,480
And the key to treating addiction
is helping the client regain sobriety.

371
00:26:04,063 --> 00:26:05,146
Sobriety?

