512
00:38:12,688 --> 00:38:16,896
I'm sorry, but what is this?

513
00:38:17,771 --> 00:38:21,063
Are these two going to tell us
the secret to a happy marriage?

514
00:38:22,521 --> 00:38:26,355
No. They're not a married couple.

515
00:38:27,688 --> 00:38:28,646
What?

516
00:38:31,438 --> 00:38:33,688
They're in an open marriage.

517
00:38:34,438 --> 00:38:37,521
They both have partners
outside their marriage,

518
00:38:37,605 --> 00:38:39,230
with mutual consent.

519
00:38:39,313 --> 00:38:41,313
I have a husband.

520
00:38:42,480 --> 00:38:46,188
I love my wife,
but I can't get it up anymore.

521
00:38:46,771 --> 00:38:49,938
We stopped having sex
after we had a child,

522
00:38:50,021 --> 00:38:51,980
and things became awkward between us.

523
00:38:52,063 --> 00:38:54,396
That's when Dr. Shimotori suggested it.

524
00:38:55,271 --> 00:38:57,896
How did things change
after trying an open marriage?

525
00:38:58,730 --> 00:39:03,146
The spark came back,
and our marriage became more peaceful.

526
00:39:03,230 --> 00:39:06,605
I no longer felt pressured
to sleep with my wife

527
00:39:06,688 --> 00:39:10,271
or guilty for not being able to.

528
00:39:10,355 --> 00:39:12,355
Mentally, it was a huge relief.

529
00:39:14,313 --> 00:39:19,396
One of the scary things about addiction
is how it escalates over time.

530
00:39:21,396 --> 00:39:26,146
Relationships with numerous partners
can also lead to serious risks.

531
00:39:28,688 --> 00:39:33,563
In that sense, what could work,
though it's a powerful prescription,

532
00:39:34,313 --> 00:39:37,021
is to narrow the focus
of your addiction to one partner

533
00:39:38,105 --> 00:39:42,105
to achieve sexual sobriety.

534
00:39:46,105 --> 00:39:48,313
I believe this is one way to do that.

535
00:39:50,355 --> 00:39:51,938
OPEN MARRIAGE CONTRACT

536
00:39:52,021 --> 00:39:54,105
Don't mess with me.

537
00:39:54,188 --> 00:39:57,855
I asked you to treat my wife's addiction.

538
00:39:58,896 --> 00:40:00,313
I can't accept this.

539
00:40:15,230 --> 00:40:16,855
That's…

540
00:40:17,855 --> 00:40:20,021
That's so…

541
00:40:33,688 --> 00:40:35,355
Fine.

542
00:40:38,355 --> 00:40:39,438
Wait.

543
00:40:44,480 --> 00:40:50,980
After hearing their story,
I see there are relationships like that.

544
00:40:54,313 --> 00:40:56,021
But I…

545
00:40:59,230 --> 00:41:00,646
I…

546
00:41:02,438 --> 00:41:06,938
Then what are we supposed to do?

547
00:41:14,563 --> 00:41:18,063
There is one more prescription.

548
00:41:23,730 --> 00:41:25,355
Would you like to try it?

549
00:42:02,813 --> 00:42:05,105
I've always hated it.

550
00:42:06,938 --> 00:42:13,188
It's rough, ugly, and clumsy.

551
00:42:14,521 --> 00:42:18,980
I didn't realize you felt that way.

552
00:42:20,480 --> 00:42:23,688
I'm sorry I couldn't tell you this
until now but…

553
00:42:25,688 --> 00:42:29,605
I love this hand.

554
00:43:36,938 --> 00:43:42,480
<i>Her hand was her very soul</i>
<i>which was wounded during childhood.</i>

555
00:43:43,396 --> 00:43:46,313
<i>Her mother's words,</i>
<i>which demanded perfection,</i>

556
00:43:46,396 --> 00:43:49,271
<i>made her believe it wasn't worthy of love.</i>

557
00:43:50,063 --> 00:43:56,105
<i>Whenever she felt pain in her hand,</i>
<i>she remembered feeling unloved,</i>

558
00:43:56,188 --> 00:43:59,896
<i>and sought validation through sex.</i>

559
00:44:01,813 --> 00:44:05,105
Loving her hand…

560
00:44:05,605 --> 00:44:10,396
That was the prescription for this case.

561
00:44:11,271 --> 00:44:15,938
To create an experience
of being loved despite being hurt.

562
00:44:16,021 --> 00:44:22,605
But this is just the starting point
of her treatment.

563
00:44:22,688 --> 00:44:26,605
In Japan, sex therapy
still isn't widely understood,

564
00:44:26,688 --> 00:44:30,188
and it carries a stigma
of being something shady.

565
00:44:30,271 --> 00:44:35,605
Many people are also reluctant
to talk about their sexual problems.

566
00:44:36,605 --> 00:44:41,896
That is why I want to change that,
even if only a little.

567
00:44:44,355 --> 00:44:49,980
After all, everyone has concerns
when it comes to sex.

568
00:45:03,855 --> 00:45:06,146
Sexology, was it?

569
00:45:07,438 --> 00:45:08,271
Huh?

570
00:45:10,063 --> 00:45:11,605
Sexology.

571
00:45:12,855 --> 00:45:13,730
Oh…

572
00:45:14,605 --> 00:45:15,688
Yes.

573
00:45:15,771 --> 00:45:17,605
Academic freedom is one thing,

574
00:45:17,688 --> 00:45:20,813
but please avoid damaging
the medical school's reputation.

575
00:45:22,646 --> 00:45:24,146
Dean Toyohara.

576
00:45:24,230 --> 00:45:25,896
Hello.

577
00:45:26,480 --> 00:45:30,271
Well, sexology is a hot topic right now.

578
00:45:30,355 --> 00:45:35,355
He's a guest speaker this time,
but I'd like him to teach regularly

579
00:45:35,438 --> 00:45:36,688
as a favor to his mentor.

580
00:45:38,105 --> 00:45:39,105
Oh?

581
00:45:57,771 --> 00:45:59,813
-Good night.
-Good night.

582
00:46:06,355 --> 00:46:08,563
What?

583
00:46:09,521 --> 00:46:12,105
Let's hit another bar!

584
00:46:12,605 --> 00:46:15,563
Hey. I'm going home.

585
00:46:15,646 --> 00:46:18,021
We're going to another bar!

586
00:46:20,146 --> 00:46:23,563
-I'm going home!
-Come on. One more bar!

587
00:46:30,730 --> 00:46:31,896
Wanna go home?

588
00:46:32,396 --> 00:46:34,396
Yeah. I'm going home with you.

589
00:46:56,855 --> 00:47:01,605
FIELD REPORTER
YUMI ICHINOSE

590
00:47:04,938 --> 00:47:06,605
I HAD SO MUCH FUN I DRANK TOO MUCH

591
00:47:06,688 --> 00:47:07,688
I HAD FUN TOO

592
00:47:07,771 --> 00:47:08,980
LET'S GRAB DRINKS AGAIN

593
00:47:09,063 --> 00:47:09,896
SURE

594
00:47:17,063 --> 00:47:19,980
YUMI ICHINOSE

595
00:47:20,521 --> 00:47:22,938
BLOCK

596
00:47:25,063 --> 00:47:29,355
DO YOU WANT TO BLOCK YUMI ICHINOSE?
CANCEL / BLOCK

597
00:47:30,813 --> 00:47:32,230
YOU HAVE BLOCKED YUMI ICHINOSE

598
00:48:08,521 --> 00:48:10,605
Seventeen years since the incident…

599
00:48:11,105 --> 00:48:14,021
You reunited with your first love.

600
00:48:19,855 --> 00:48:21,938
Do you still have feelings for her?

601
00:48:26,646 --> 00:48:31,605
It would be presumptuous of me
to have romantic feelings.

602
00:48:33,021 --> 00:48:34,271
Presumptuous?

603
00:48:42,563 --> 00:48:47,021
I don't have the right to love anyone.

604
00:48:50,438 --> 00:48:55,771
I don't even want
to imagine myself having sex.

605
00:49:01,438 --> 00:49:04,230
I became a sex therapist…

606
00:49:10,938 --> 00:49:13,396
because I hate sex.

607
00:51:15,188 --> 00:51:17,105
Subtitle translation by: Yuki Asami

